<section id="about" class="ns-section ns-about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="ns-container ns-about__grid">
    <figure class="ns-about__portrait">
      <%= image_tag "profile_pic_2.jpg", width: 240, height: 240, loading: "lazy", alt: "Spencer Norman" %>
      <figcaption><strong>Spencer Norman</strong><span>Norman Simplified</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div>
      <header class="ns-section-heading">
        <h2 id="about-title" class="t-heading">Who does the work</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="ns-prose">
        <p>I have spent 11 years building software. From 2016 to 2025 I was the lead developer at United Networks of America, on a pharmacy API used by 9,800+ locations and a multi-tenant pricing platform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ns-example">
        <h3 class="t-heading" id="example-title">Implementation example</h3>
        <dl class="ns-example__steps">
          <div>
            <dt>Before</dt>
            <dd>Staff retyped packet fields by hand.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>After</dt>
            <dd>Extracted records went to a review queue, and uncertain fields were held for a person.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <p>I built this during that employment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
